meta {
  name: Get All Report By Inventory
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/report/:search/:inventory_id
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  search: Nivea%20Extra%20White%20Repair%20&%20Protect
  inventory_id: e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Report By Inventory

  This request is used to get all report found in a inventory by inventory name and report id. This request interacts with the MySQL database, have a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name          | Type   | Required | Description    | Example                                          |
  |----------------|--------|----------|-----------------|---------------------------------------------------|
  | search         | string | yes      | Inventory Name | Nivea%20Extra%20White%20Repair%20&%20Protect     |
  | inventory_id   | string | yes      | Inventory ID   | e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9              |

  ## Responses

  **200 — report fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "history fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "report_title": "Report A",
          "report_desc": "This is a report description",
          "report_category": "Shopping Cart",
          "is_reminder": 0,
          "reminder_at": {},
          "total_variety": 1,
          "total_item": 1,
          "report_items": "Nivea Extra White Repair & Protect",
          "item_price": 20000,
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — report failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "report not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}